  "releaseNotes": "Adds reusable native Avalonia and Uno component hosts with shared isolated package resources, lifecycle, capability bridge wiring, recovery, diagnostics, and release coverage; also adds the native in-memory Web Storage compatibility subset, ordered fail-closed document-start scripts, IndexedDB-specific SDK diagnostics, four-engine startup coverage, and corrected external script-source accounting while retaining native ABI 3.",
